.uk/btc/.\n\nThe main website at farside.co.uk/btc/ displays Bitcoin ETF flow data in a table format, showing daily flows for various Bitcoin spot ETFs including tickers like IBIT, FBTC, GBTC, and ARKB. The data includes both individual ETF flows and total net flows across all Bitcoin ETFs.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"234a0a44-d7ab-4aa5-b422-079e4356310f","uuid":"df3a5ad0-c30b-45ef-aa89-e2abcc154706","timestamp":"2026-09-17T14:42:32.226Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"farside.co.uk Bitcoin ETF flow","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01SHvoVZFunBuAu1eYwS8qRD","content":[{"title":"Bitcoin ETF Flow (US$m) – Farside Investors","url":"https://farside.co.uk/btc/"},{"title":"Farside Investors","url":"https://farside.co.uk/"},{"title":"Bitcoin ETF Flow – All Data (US$m) – Farside Investors","url":"https://farside.co.uk/bitcoin-etf-flow-all-data/"},{"title":"Farside Investors (@FarsideUK) on X","url":"https://x.com/farsideuk?lang=en"},{"title":"Farside Bitcoin ETF Flow Table | PDF | Money | Asset Management","url":"https://es.scribd.com/document/736954099/Bitcoin-ETF-Flow-Farside-Investors"},{"title":"Farside Investors - Bitcoin ETF Daily Flow - X","url":"https://x.com/FarsideUK/status/1943154928890917032"},{"title":"Bitcoin Derivative Charts – Farside Investors","url":"https://farside.co.uk/bitcoin-futures/"},{"title":"Bitcoin: Farside Upgrades ETF Flow Charts | Flash News Detail | Blockchain.News","url":"https://blockchain.news/flashnews/bitcoin-farside-upgrades-etf-flow-charts"},{"title":"Farside ETF Flows API | farside · Parse","url":"https://parse.bot/marketplace/d1af202b-4969-4869-bcf2-d16d71525d36/farside-co-uk-api"},{"title":"Farside Equity Fund – Farside Investors","url":"https://farside.co.uk/fund/"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about farside.co.uk and Bitcoin ETF flow:\n\nFarside provides daily ETF flow data, in US$ milli